## Objective

Write a durable coverage-checkpoint audit for the five completed G tasks and
their design evidence. Preserve the manifest as pending while its QB-A
editorial boundary remains incomplete. The checkpoint is successful when it
records that boundary accurately and `GD0002` owns the one bounded successor
wave. Do not rewrite this GC0001 task file; write the audit to
