## Output list

- `design-evidence/gc0001-coverage-checkpoint.md`: the coverage, ownership,
  dependency, pending-boundary, and successor audit for this checkpoint.
- `GD0002.md`: the sole bounded successor for the recorded QB-A editorial
  acceptance work. It already exists and must remain the only successor.

## Existing audit findings to preserve in the output

## Ownership, cap, coverage, and dependency closure

| Owning batch | Declared G outputs | Cap | Canonical coverage | Closure result |
